DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       _E_p_s_f_f_i_t fits an EPSF file (encapsulated PostScript) to a given bounding
       box.   The  coordinates of the box are given by ((llllxx,,llllyy)) for the lower
       left, and ((uurrxx,,uurryy)) for the upper right, in PostScript units (points).

       If no input or output files are specified, _e_p_s_f_f_i_t read from the  stan‐
       dard input and writes to the standard output.

