       --cc        Center the image in the given bounding box.

       --rr        Rotate the image by 90 degrees counter-clockwise.

       --aa        Adjust  the aspect ratio to fit the bounding box. The default
                 is to preserve the aspect ratio.

       --mm        Rotates the image to maximise the size if it  would  fit  the
                 specified bounding box better.

       --ss        Add  a  _s_h_o_w_p_a_g_e at the end of the file to force the image to
